*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0034
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 268
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0034.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 C-AG-YY            PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 WS-TXAMT           PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 CC-CD              PIC X(2).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 FR-FLG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM MINOR-TXN-CHECK
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "FR-FLG=" FR-FLG
    STOP RUN.
MINOR-TXN-CHECK.
    IF C-AG-YY < 18 AND WS-TXAMT > 10000.00
        MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    IF WS-TXAMT > 40000 AND (CC-CD = 'XC' OR 'XD')
        MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
    END-IF.
